OL,3,GNEWSAFather 'couldn't comprehend' fatal
OL,4,Acrash ID error
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father who was mistakenly told his
OL,7,Fson had survived a car crash has told
OL,8,Fan inquest it felt like his family had
OL,9,Fbeen through "two deaths".
OL,11,FJoshua Johnson, 18, and Summer Louise
OL,12,FScott, 17, died when a Toyota Corolla
OL,13,Fleft the road near Rotherham, South
OL,14,FYorkshire, and hit a tree on 13
OL,15,FDecember.
OL,17,FPolice initially misidentified the
OL,18,Ffront seat passenger Trevor Wynn, then
OL,19,F17, as the male who had died in the
OL,20,Fcrash, with the mistake becoming clear
OL,21,Fwhen Trevor came out of sedation three
OL,22,Fweeks later.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
